# Locked behaviors and Guideline Index

Before changing behavior in files under `src/`, check the **Guideline Index** and preserve the described behaviors for any affected area.

- **Guideline Index:** `docs/GUIDELINE_INDEX.md` (or the compliance audit at `docs/APP_GUIDELINES_COMPLIANCE.md`).
- For each locked behavior listed there, preserve the behavior and follow the linked guideline doc. Do not remove or alter the intended behavior (e.g. rollover excludes recurring tasks; scheduler respects category hours and calendar events).
- **No hardcoding:** When editing code, use constants from `timing-constants.ts`, `business-constants.ts`, `layout-constants.ts`, `ai-config.ts`, `notification-constants.ts`, and `context-defaults.ts`. Do not introduce magic numbers or literal business values in source files.
- Reference the Guideline Index and specific guideline docs by path when in doubt; do not inline numeric rules or thresholds in prompts or comments that duplicate constants.
